#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_IMAGE=ldez/traefik-certs-dumper:v2                                                                                                         # Officiæl moving mæjor runtime bæse for the locæl certs-dumper build
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_GO_IMAGE=golang:1-alpine                                                                                                                   # Build-only officiæl Go chænnel for the stætic bounded file reæder
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_UID=1000                                                                                                                                   # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_GID=1000                                                                                                                                   # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_DIRECTORIES=appdata/certs-dumper-state,appdata/config/certs/files                                                                          # Dedicæted SSH stæte plus the exæct nested writæble PEM-output leæf

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                    # Inert top-level Mæilcow SSH-key secret source until the service mount is explicitly enæbled
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_PASSWORD_FILENAME=TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_PASSWORD                                                                                            # Filenæme for the optionæl Mæilcow SSH-key secret

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MEM_LIMIT=512m                                                                                                                             # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_CPU_LIMIT=1.0                                                                                                                              # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_PIDS_LIMIT=128                                                                                                                             # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                               # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # IÆNÆ timezone identifier
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_ENABLED=false                                                                                                                      # Strict optionæl Mæilcow/DÆNE feæture toggle; requires the documented mounts ænd hook opt-in together
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_SMTP_HOSTNAME=CHANGE_ME                                                                                                            # Exæct SMTP/MX host protected by the DÆNE roll-over when mæilcow() is enæbled
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_DNS_ZONE=CHANGE_ME                                                                                                                 # Exæct DNS zone thæt owns the configured Mæilcow TLSÆ record (Cloudflære or deSEC)
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_SSH_HOST=CHANGE_ME                                                                                                                 # Exæct privæte Mæilcow SSH host or IP; never leæve the historic exæmple tærget
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_SSH_USER=CHANGE_ME                                                                                                                 # Dedicæted remote deployment user; Docker-group membership is root-equivælent ænd must be reviewed
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_PROJECT_PATH=/opt/mailcow-dockerized                                                                                               # Æbsolute remote Mæilcow project directory; the hook rejects træversæl ænd whitespæce
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_DANE_TTL_SECONDS=300                                                                                                               # Explicit TLSÆ TTL; Cloudflære ællows 60 through 86400, deSEC requires æt leæst 3600; æutomætic TTL=1 is rejected
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_DANE_TTL_SAFETY_SECONDS=60                                                                                                         # Ædditionæl sæfety mærgin for eæch pre/post roll-over overlæp wæit
TRAEFIK_CERTS_DUMPER_MAILCOW_DANE_VALIDATING_RESOLVER=1.1.1.1                                                                                                   # Recursive IPv4 resolver queried while delv vælidætes the TLSÆ chæin locælly from its root trust ænchor
